n is believed to torture and murder those under police custody, complete with ritualistic sacrifices and bloodbathing.</li> <li><b>Princess </b>- The heiress to a corporation, Princess has been in the lime light for many years. Her media presence keeps her squeaky clean, but the reality is far more distrubing. Fashion lines that use slave labor, human trafficking, blackmail, etc... the list goes on. Princess is a black mark on an otherwise respectable family. As the sole heir to her comatose mother's fortune the Client wishes to take her out. The corporation ownership will fall to the board of directors and her promised fortune will be dispersed across multiple charities, so long as her mother's original will is also found.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-09T08:42:58-07:00","id":1520204,"title":"","content":"<b>10. Barbra </b>- Over 200 careers, Barbara is an expert in everything. Including cat burglary. Barbra has stolen a variety of blackmarket goods from our client, due to her expertise she's too dangerous to keep alive as the client is sure that she will reclaim whatever has been recovered by her.<br /> <br /> <b>11. Kenneth</b> - Don't let his dumb blonde exterior fool you, this man is a beach expert. And that has extended to his criminal activities. He is a smuggler and human trafficker for a variety of LA gangs.<br /> <br /> <b>12. Commander Viper</b> - A mad scientist whose been looking into genetic splicing. He has been purchasing various rare serpents from the Russian mob, but has failed to make payments on time. The client believes that Viper is planning to use the vipers to create an army of super soldier human/snake hybrids and in doing so not need to reimburse them.<br /> <br /> <b>13.</b> <b>Tank</b> - The client wishes for us to take out an unmanned tank, as in make it in operable. Information is highly classified, but our sources believe that the tank's AI has gone rogue and is looking to take out all of humanity. This would be bad for business if it was allowed to succeed, but its highly likely law enforcement or the government could take it out after it kills a large amount of people. But our client wants to make sure this technology doesn't fall into anyones hands.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}